      "id": 1,
      "text": "Shannon is in Sampson County, whose first courthouse was built in 1784 from heavy hewn logs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shannon%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Cape Fear & Yadkin Valley Railroad, built in 1886, once ran through the area, linking Sanford to Wilmington.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitsampsonnc.com/discover-history-and-find-your-roots-in-sampson-county/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Every September, the Coharie Tribe hosts its Annual Cultural POW WOW Festival at the Tribal Community Center along US 421, showcasing their heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitsampsonnc.com/discover-history-and-find-your-roots-in-sampson-county/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Sampson County History Museum Village, a “village” of eleven buildings on a two‑acre campus, displays relocated 18th‑century cabins and a 1920s general store.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        4,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitsampsonnc.com/discover-history-and-find-your-roots-in-sampson-county/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2019, a new Military and Veterans Building opened in the county, adding a modern landmark to the historic landscape.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitsampsonnc.com/discover-history-and-find-your-roots-in-sampson-county/",
